   "\"v1/TRANSFER/{fromUser}/{toUser}/{amount}\" moves amount from fromUser to toUser and answers \"OK\" when both are registered, distinct, friends, and fromUser's balance is at least amount; otherwise \"ERROR\" with no change.",
